Day 48 of the Claude AI Coding Challenge – Build The Verdict Engine 

Making the right decision is often harder than finding the available options. Whether you're buying a laptop, choosing a phone, comparing cars, or evaluating any product, the challenge isn't information—it's knowing what matters most to you.

Today I built The Verdict Engine—an AI-powered decision platform that transforms complex comparisons into confident, data-driven recommendations.

Key Features

• Personalized comparison criteria based on your needs

• Weighted scoring to prioritize what matters most

• Live ranking updates as you adjust preferences

• Interactive comparison tables with detailed insights

• Transparent reasoning showing how every recommendation is generated

• Premium HTML application with an intuitive and responsive interface



